    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "System Timetable\nEffective February 15-March 31, 2001\nMORE NONSTOPS\nTO MORE TIME\nZONES THAN\nANYBODY ELSE.\nMore international destinations\nthan any other U.S. airline.\nIncludes Continental Express and\nContinental Micronesia service.\nContinental Airlines\nWork Hard\nFly Right.®",
      "For reservations call your\ntravel agent or\n1-800-523-FARE\n(1-800-523-3273)\nFor complete vacation packages\ncall Continental Airlines Vacations at\n1-800-634-5555\nFor automated flight\ninformation call\n1-800-784-4444\nAlways ask for an\n#TICKET\nPurchase tickets online or\ndownload the timetable at\nwww.continental.com\nContinental\nAirlines\nFTT021501"
    ],
